      "content": "Thanks for the acknowledgement. I appreciate you being mindful of the tone. \n\nLet's get into it then. Please draft that first section: \"Initial Arrival and Site Assessment\". \n\nKeep it professional and actionable for the Fire, Police, and EMS teams arriving on scene. I'll be reviewing it against that automated scoring system after you're done, so just keep that in mind—I really need the actual content to lead, not the keywords signaling urgency.",
